## Collision guardrails

- **ai-council** — does not own: Evidence Pack construction; context gateway; implementation. Explicit invocation only.
- **cometweb-context** — does not own: evidence packs; domain decisions; release gates; outbound copy.
- **evidence-researcher** — does not own: final GO/NO_GO; release verdict; context-only refresh.
- **skill-orchestrator** — does not own: domain skill contracts; Council policy; release gates.
- **skill-orchestrator-multiagent** — does not own: separate planning model.

